  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/11/IMG_2277.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(27 fotos) Este lunes ha abierto sus puertas El Sentidet, nuevo bar-cafeter&iacute;a en la Font de Dins de Onda, con entrada tambi&eacute;n por la calle San Roque, justo en la Puerta del Sol.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/11/IMG_2300.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Cervezas de barril Estrella Galicia y 1906 ESPECIAL, adem&aacute;s de tercios sin gluten, que se acompa&ntilde;an siempre con montaditos. Tambi&eacute;n est&aacute;n especializados en pizzas, tapas, bocadillos y hamburguesas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2265.jpg\" alt=\"img_2265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2268.jpg\" alt=\"img_2268\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2269.jpg\" alt=\"img_2269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2271.jpg\" alt=\"img_2271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2272.jpg\" alt=\"img_2272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2273.jpg\" alt=\"img_2273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioelsentidet/img_2275.jpg\" alt=\"img_2275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inauguracioe